primary_text:
We love everything about our Cool Peel laser facial! 

This laser is great for stimulating collagen while improving texture, helps with pigmentation and reduces fine lines and wrinkles around the eyes and mouth. 

To understand exactly what you need for your face and skin, come see me in my NYC or NJ studios.

I can’t wait to see you!

To schedule, book online at: www.skinsplendid.com

